Package: xfconf
Version: @DEB_XFCONF_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfconf/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libxfce4util7, dbus
Description: Configuration storage and query system for Xfce
 Xfconf is the configuration store used throughout Xfce. This package contains
 the libxfconf-0 library, the xfconfd daemon (a session-bus service) and the
 xfconf-query command-line tool.
